sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Tailnet User
    participant CLI as Local Pi Durable CLI
    participant Browser as Browser Client
    participant Edge as Voice Edge
    participant Gateway as Agent Gateway
    participant Owner as Pi Durable Owner
    participant SQLite as Owner SQLite
    participant Effects as Workspace and Artifact Effects
    participant Store as S3 Workspace / Result Store
    participant Pi as Pi Durable Conversation
    participant Tools as Host or Gondolin Tools
    participant Model as Model Provider

    alt Voice session submission
        User->>Browser: Request scratch or repository work
        Browser->>Edge: Submit owner-scoped task
        Edge->>Gateway: Forward authenticated request
        Gateway->>Owner: Submit native agent-run task over private HTTP
        Owner->>SQLite: Persist task and request ID
        Owner-->>Gateway: Return stable public task ID
        Gateway-->>Browser: Return task ID and current result state
    else Native CLI submission
        User->>CLI: Submit owner-scoped agent-run task
        CLI->>Owner: Submit directly over private Unix socket
        Owner->>SQLite: Persist task, identity, and display metadata
        Owner-->>CLI: Return native task ID
    end
    Owner->>Effects: Prepare task workspace
    Effects->>Store: Materialize workspace
    alt Host execution
        Owner->>Pi: Reopen native task conversation
        Pi->>Tools: Run host file and shell tools
    else Gondolin execution
        Owner->>Pi: Reopen native task conversation
        Pi->>Tools: Run file and shell tools in task VM
    end
    Pi->>Model: Generate response
    Pi-->>Owner: Final response and tool changes
    Owner->>Effects: Format response and capture result
    Effects->>Store: Capture bounded artifacts
    Effects-->>Owner: Return public result
    Owner->>SQLite: Checkpoint terminal result
    User->>Browser: Refresh task
    Browser->>Edge: Read task state
    Edge->>Gateway: Query owner-scoped task
    Gateway->>Owner: List native CLI tasks for this identity
    Gateway->>Owner: Get native task snapshot
    Owner-->>Gateway: State and bounded result
    Gateway-->>Browser: Public task view
    opt Listen to agent
        Browser->>Edge: Poll bounded progress after cursor
        Edge->>Gateway: Read owner-scoped progress
        Gateway->>Owner: Read task checkpoint progress after cursor
        Gateway-->>Browser: Safe progress for narration
    end
